    "title": "Nani \u2212 Baby Monitor Cam",
    "description": "With the NANI Baby Monitor Video App you can turn any smartphone into a reliable camera and use another device as a dedicated parent monitor. Whether over Wi-Fi or on the go through the mobile network, you will not lose sight of your children.\r\n\r\nThe NANI Baby Monitor App is an audio and video nanny cam app which has following features:\r\n\r\n<b> UNLIMITED RANGE - WIFI, MOBILE NETWORK - 3G/LTE </b>\r\nWhether you are at home, at work, or on the go, our app seamlessly works with any internet connection. Wi-Fi, 3G, 4G, LTE. We support all types of connections.\r\n\r\n<b> UNLIMITED CAMERAS AND PARENT DEVICES </b>\r\nConnect an unlimited number of cameras and parent monitors simultaneously. No matter how many children you need to watch, our app allows this effortlessly and conveniently.\r\n\r\n<b> SOUND DETECTION </b>\r\nOur intelligent sound monitoring function keeps you updated on any noises in the room and notifies you immediately.\r\n\r\n<b> MOTION DETECTION </b>\r\nOur advanced motion detection system is specifically designed for baby monitors, providing vigilant surveillance over your little one's movements. It ensures you're promptly notified of any activity in the baby's room.\r\n\r\n<b> TALK TO YOUR BABY </b>\r\nThe two-way video and voice communication function is a real innovation for busy parents. Comfort your child with the sound of your voice and your smile.\r\n\r\n<b> VIDEO CAPTURE </b>\r\nUpon detecting any sound or movement, our baby monitor camera swiftly captures a snapshot and records a brief video clip. These are then securely uploaded to the cloud, allowing you to conveniently review the event history and stay informed about your baby's activities.\r\n\r\n<b> UNLIMITED CLOUD STORAGE </b>\r\nOur service offers unlimited cloud storage for all your photos and video recordings. To ensure your privacy and manage storage efficiently, all stored data is automatically and securely purged from the cloud after a 30-day period.\r\n\r\n<b> CAMERA REMOTE CONTROL </b>\r\nControl the baby device cameras from the parent device. You can switch between front and rear cameras, adjust the noise level, and turn the light on or off.\r\n\r\n<b>FLOATING WINDOW</b>\r\nYou can continue using your device while the camera feed is being streamed in a small floating window (Picture in Picture feature).\r\n\r\n<b> MULTI-PLATFORM USAGE </b>\r\nYou can use one device with the Android system and another with the iOS system, or both devices with the same system.\r\n\r\n<b> INTUITIVE DESIGN </b>\r\nThe app has been developed according to the latest technological standards and offers a simple and intuitive design as well as app control.\r\n\r\n<b> LIVE VIDEO </b>\r\nThe app occasionally checks the connection and automatically re-establishes a secure connection if your smartphone temporarily loses internet reception.\r\n\r\n<b> FREE TRIAL </b>\r\nWe provide a 3-day free trial for all new users. After this period, a subscription is required to continue using the app.\r\n\r\nYou can use the Nani - Baby Monitor App in the following scenarios:\r\n\r\nIf you want to monitor your baby or child while you are in another room within your home.\r\nIf you are not at home but still want to keep an eye on your child's behavior.\r\nIf you have multiple children and need to monitor multiple rooms or cribs simultaneously.\r\nIf you temporarily leave your child in the care of a nanny or relatives and want to ensure everything is okay.\r\nIf you want to use your old phone as a baby monitor.\r\n\r\nNani - Baby Monitor Camera App - No. 1 solution for the safety of your children.",
